{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38089","headline":"八月六日作四首 四 · 韩偓","name":"八月六日作四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坐看包藏负国恩，无才不得预经纶。\n袁安坠睫寻忧汉，贾谊濡毫但过秦。\n威凤鬼应遮矢射，灵犀天与隔埃尘。\n堤防瓜李能终始，免媿於心负此身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}